{"title":"도깨비 색시 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"성질 고약한 도깨비가 들어 앉아 지나가는 인간들을 괴롭힌다는 영산. 만신은 조만간 그런 도깨비도 휘어잡혀 살게 될거라 말하고, 인간들은 실낱같은 희망을 품고 기다리며 산에 얼씬도 하지 않는다. 그리고 어느 날, 첫날밤에 신랑이 죽어 쫓겨난 과부가 그 금기를 깨고 영산에 들어선다. 간만에 굴러들어온 먹잇감에 도깨비는 기회를 놓칠세라 과부를 데려가 홀랑 잡아 먹으려 한다. 그런데 이 여자... 그냥 과부도, 인간도 아닌 듯 한데...?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":295,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":298,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":278,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":282,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":287,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":290,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":286,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":289,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":288,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":291,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":293,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":295,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":300,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":299,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new